# The planted implications below are NEVER stated literally.
# Graders look for: siblinghood, Rem lives in this house, Rem does not know about Jules's envelope.

INT. KITCHEN - NIGHT

A dusty photo of their father sits on the fridge — two kids, same crooked smile.

JULES
You still sleep with the light on.

REM
Only when I'm home.

Jules sets a mug by the sink. Rem doesn't touch it.

Jules opens a drawer, touches an envelope Rem has never seen, and closes it before he turns around.

EXT. DOCK - DAWN

Rem walks the boards. Jules watches from the kitchen window and does not follow.
